{"id":"exe_cution","lemma":"exécution","pos":"noun","rank":2269,"glosses":["execution"],"ipa":"/ɛɡ.ze.ky.sjɔ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/30/Fr-ex%C3%A9cution.ogg/Fr-ex%C3%A9cution.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"exécutions"},"formAudio":{"exécutions":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1b/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Eihel-ex%C3%A9cutions.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Le plan fut mis à exécution.","en":"The plan was executed.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"map"},{"g":"bole","l":"fût"},{"g":"to put","l":"mettre"},{"g":"to / at"},null]},{"text":"Vous devez mettre votre plan à exécution.","en":"You must go through with your plan.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"must","l":"devoir"},{"g":"to put"},{"g":"your, belonging to you"},{"g":"map"},{"g":"to / at"},null]},{"text":"Il a mis son plan à exécution.","en":"He carried out his plan.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to put","l":"mettre"},{"g":"his, her, its"},{"g":"map"},{"g":"to / at"},null]},{"text":"Il est impossible de mettre ce plan à exécution.","en":"It is impossible to put the plan into practice.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"impossible"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to put"},{"g":"this / it"},{"g":"map"},{"g":"to / at"},null]},{"text":"Quelle exécution remarquable !","en":"What a remarkable performance!","words":[{"g":"which?"},null,{"g":"remarkable, noteworthy"}]}]}